          - latency_optimized
        notes:
          - "Picker description: Fastest for quick answers"
          - "`haiku` resolves to claude-haiku-5-5 on 2.1.296, as the Haiku 5.5 picker row sets it (/status: haiku (claude-haiku-5-5)). It resolved to claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 through 2.1.288, when this entry was labelled Haiku 4.5; that model now has its own entry. The 200000 context limit described Haiku 4.5 and moved with it."
        source_names:
          - Haiku
