                description: May use excessive tokens resulting in long response times or overthinking. Use
                  sparingly for the hardest tasks.
            semanticTags:
              - reasoning_intensity
            default: medium
      - default: false
        id: claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
        label: Haiku 4.5
        capabilityTags:
          - tool_use
          - latency_optimized
        limits:
          contextWindowTokens: 200000
        notes:
          - "Picker description: Fastest for quick answers"
          - "Executes `claude-haiku-4-5-20251001`, the value the picker row sets on 2.1.296. Before 2026-10-14 Cats reached this model through the `haiku` entry. The picker shows Effort not supported for this row."
        source_names:
          - Haiku 4.5
        execution:
          model: claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
        controls: []
      - default: false
        id: claude-sonnet-5
        label: Sonnet 5
        notes:
          - "Picker description: Efficient for routine tasks"
          - Executes `claude-sonnet-5`, the value the picker row sets on 2.1.285. Before 2026-09-30 Cats
