  - provider: kilo
    backend: cli
    selection_mode: full
    source_cli: Kilo
    cli_version: 7.8.8
    last_updated: 2026-10-14
    basis:
      channel:
        id: kilo
        label: kilo
    notes:
      - "The complete Kilo Gateway list of Kilo CLI 7.8.8, replacing the 2026-09-18 shortlist at the operator's request on 2026-10-14: the 327 models of `kilo models kilo --verbose --pure`, which the operator chose over the picker as the scope. Evidence: docs/research/fixtures/kilo-7.8.8/model-list.probe.redacted.json and docs/research/2026-10-14-shortlists-to-full.md."
      - "Order and coverage come from the /models dialog walked with Capture-KiloPicker.ps1 on Windows: Recommended (9 rows, including the Auto routing rows) then Kilo Gateway (318). Kilo moves Recommended rows out of the gateway section but keeps Recent rows in it, and Recent is left out here because it is per user. Together they are the 327 listed models. Evidence: docs/research/fixtures/kilo-7.8.8/model-picker.agent-capture.redacted.json."
      - "Labels are the listed names, trimmed (the Gemma 4 26B A4B name ends with a space). kilo/google/gemini-4-argon keeps Google: Gemini 4 Argon: the picker showed a temporary (50% off) promotion in its name, which the list also carried by 06:34, and the probe acknowledges that value."
      - "Variant is Kilo's Select variant dialog: Default, which sends no variant, then the model's own variants in listed order under their raw names (observed: Default, instant, thinking). Models without variants have no control. The value travels as the native prompt's variant field. This replaces the fixed thinking variant the shortlist held for Seed 2.1 Turbo and Nano Banana Pro; their old labels stay in source_names."
