  - provider: goose
    backend: cli
    selection_mode: full
    source_cli: Goose
    cli_version: 1.54.0
    last_updated: 2026-10-14
    basis:
      channel:
        id: chatgpt_codex
        label: chatgpt_codex
    notes:
      - "Complete chatgpt_codex (ChatGPT subscription OAuth) model list of Goose 1.54.0: the six models of its built-in CHATGPT_CODEX_KNOWN_MODELS list, which goose configure and the in-session /model completion offer for this provider in this order. The provider has no live model fetch. Read from the v1.54.0 source tag and found in the installed goose.exe, which is byte-identical to the official release asset; no CLI session, configure run or login was used. Labels are the raw IDs Goose shows."
      - "The operator moved this scope from the 2026-09-23 six-row shortlist (every row fixed to Thinking Off) to the full-catalog group on 2026-10-14. The membership did not change; the rows gain Goose's thinking-effort menu."
      - "Thinking effort follows Goose's own menu (Select thinking effort: Off, Low, Medium, High, Max; one global menu in goose configure). Cats sends it per row as Goose's native model suffix: off -none, low -low, medium -medium, high -high, max -xhigh, because Goose parses no -max suffix. The chatgpt_codex backend then sends none, low, medium, high or xhigh for the four gpt-5.6 models; gpt-5.5 and gpt-5.4 do not accept none, so Off there is sent as low, the same request as Low (operator decision 2026-10-14 to keep Goose's menu on every row)."
      - "No model or effort default is marked. Goose's fallback model gpt-5.5 is a placeholder for an unset model, and goose configure starting on Off is its first item, not a default marker. Cats initializes to the first row and Off, which keeps the earlier shortlist's behavior."
      - "Evidence: docs/research/fixtures/goose-1.54.0/model-list.source.redacted.txt and docs/research/2026-10-14-catalog-refresh.md. Earlier shortlist evidence: docs/research/2026-09-23-goose-shortlist.md."
    models:
      - id: chatgpt_codex/gpt-5.6-sol
        label: gpt-5.6-sol
        source_names:
          - chatgpt_codex/gpt-5.6-sol
          - gpt-5.6-sol — Off
        execution:
          model: gpt-5.6-sol
          provider: chatgpt_codex
        controls:
          - key: goose.thinking_effort
            label: Thinking effort
            description: Goose thinking effort, sent as the native model suffix.
            kind: enum
            scope: both
            values:
              - value: "off"
                label: Off
                description: No extended thinking
              - value: low
                label: Low
                description: Better latency, lighter reasoning
              - value: medium
                label: Medium
                description: Moderate thinking
              - value: high
                label: High
                description: Deep reasoning
              - value: max
                label: Max
                description: No constraints on thinking depth
            semanticTags:
              - reasoning_intensity
      - id: chatgpt_codex/gpt-5.6-terra
        label: gpt-5.6-terra
        source_names:
          - chatgpt_codex/gpt-5.6-terra
          - gpt-5.6-terra — Off
        execution:
          model: gpt-5.6-terra
          provider: chatgpt_codex
        controls:
          - key: goose.thinking_effort
            label: Thinking effort
            description: Goose thinking effort, sent as the native model suffix.
            kind: enum
            scope: both
            values:
              - value: "off"
                label: Off
                description: No extended thinking
              - value: low
                label: Low
                description: Better latency, lighter reasoning
              - value: medium
                label: Medium
                description: Moderate thinking
              - value: high
                label: High
                description: Deep reasoning
              - value: max
                label: Max
                description: No constraints on thinking depth
            semanticTags:
              - reasoning_intensity
      - id: chatgpt_codex/gpt-5.6-luna
        label: gpt-5.6-luna
