  - provider: cline
    backend: cli
    selection_mode: full
    source_cli: Cline
    cli_version: 3.0.71
    last_updated: 2026-10-14
    basis:
      channel:
        id: cline-pass
        label: cline-pass
    notes:
      - "The complete ClinePass channel of Cline 3.0.71 (bundled @cline/llms 0.0.93), replacing the 2026-09-18 shortlist at the operator's request on 2026-10-14: the 14 subscribed cline-pass models of the installed static catalog, in its order. The operator accepted that build-time list as the channel list; the picker fetches the same list from Cline's recommended-models service and can differ. Evidence: docs/research/fixtures/cline-3.0.71/model-list.probe.redacted.json and docs/research/2026-10-14-shortlists-to-full.md."
      - "The four cline-free models the picker lists under Free (Try with limited usage, separate from ClinePass quota) are outside the ClinePass quota and stay out by the operator's decision. They remain custom strings."
      - Qwen3.8 Max is the operator-approved display name of cline-pass/qwen3.8-max, whose upstream name is the raw id.
      - "Thinking Level is the picker's thinking dialog, which offers every reasoning model the same five levels (Off, Low, Medium, High, Extra High) and preselects Medium. Execution passes --provider cline-pass --model <id> --thinking <level>; Cline then moves the level to the nearest effort the model advertises."
    models:
      - id: cline-pass/deepseek-v4.1-flash
        label: DeepSeek V4.1 Flash
        execution:
          model: cline-pass/deepseek-v4.1-flash
          provider: cline-pass
        controls:
          - key: cline.reasoning_effort
            label: Thinking Level
            kind: enum
            scope: both
            values:
              - value: none
                label: Off
              - value: low
                label: Low
              - value: medium
                label: Medium
              - value: high
                label: High
              - value: xhigh
                label: Extra High
            default: medium
