            default: medium
  - provider: devin
    backend: agent
    transport: acp_stdio
    selection_mode: full
    source_cli: Devin
    cli_version: 3000.11.3
    last_updated: 2026-10-14
    notes:
      - "The complete Devin CLI 3000.11.3 model list, replacing the 2026-09-18 shortlist at the operator's request on 2026-10-14: every family of `devin models list --format json` in its order, except the fusion family (575 main-and-sidekick combinations) and the 17 legacy MODEL_* UIDs, which the operator excluded. 47 families with 246 variant UIDs remain. Evidence: docs/research/fixtures/devin-3000.11.3/model-list.full.probe.redacted.json and docs/research/2026-10-14-shortlists-to-full.md."
      - "Every family's variants are the full product of its efforts and its Fast form, so one entry per family carries Reasoning Effort and Speed controls whose combinations select the exact UID through execution variants (devin.effort, devin.speed). Speed Fast is the fast UID suffix on Claude rows and priority on GPT rows; both read Fast in the list. Value labels are the list's own wording, such as No Thinking and XHigh."
      - "The 1M and Thinking forms are separate entries named as the list names them (GLM-5.2 1M, Claude Opus 4.6 Thinking 1M), because no control label for them is evidenced."
      - "Effort values keep the list's order and the first is the initial choice; no default is claimed. The JSON has no default field and the picker was not read."
      - Applied through ACP session/set_config_option after session/new or session/load. Fusion, legacy UIDs and other models remain custom model strings.
    models:
      - id: adaptive
        label: Adaptive
        capabilityTags:
          - tool_use
        source_names:
          - adaptive
          - Adaptive
        execution:
          model: adaptive
        controls: []
